# 统一换行符：仓库内存 LF，检出时按平台处理，避免 Windows 与 macOS 同学互相污染
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源不参与任何文本转换
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.mkv binary
*.webm binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary

# Windows 批处理脚本必须保留 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析会出错
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
